Next:
  gatekeeper endpoint add <name> --listen 127.0.0.1:8443 --upstream https://<host>
  gatekeeper endpoint trust add <name> --from-upstream
  gatekeeper config validate

A Swarm cloud needs no `trust roots add`: its certificate authority is
accepted on its own TEE evidence. Add one with `gatekeeper trust roots add`
to pin a particular cloud, or to trust a CA that publishes no evidence.
